   "extras": {
    "edit_note": "An elevated hub's ISLAND platform module (stair), 6.90 m wide, origin on its centre line at bed level: both long faces are track edges (1.55 m from each track centre). The slab under it fills the 4.00 m gap between the two lanes' viaduct decks; nothing may come nearer a track than the platform edge below 4.2 m (the gauge). The stair and its well stay on the centre line, inside the gap."
   },
